  "content_html": "<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhjiYJPAm84oR3355jnNlHmNwiPqVmvALUOfbGD4zU52Ki1L4KhkX-u7PehC4FMyNeLEWRp7902hChkHdOJkXbvYISL4fC3sW1R-KGIJ0pmghlHxc-GjbvJnWnrLtbgtAorCJfU9-uyj4NXxingMIUxQOuOLMcckSrr5WGrDqnQRyK-xKVDlJtvJuN8_pQ/s449/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"410\" data-original-width=\"449\" height=\"183\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhjiYJPAm84oR3355jnNlHmNwiPqVmvALUOfbGD4zU52Ki1L4KhkX-u7PehC4FMyNeLEWRp7902hChkHdOJkXbvYISL4fC3sW1R-KGIJ0pmghlHxc-GjbvJnWnrLtbgtAorCJfU9-uyj4NXxingMIUxQOuOLMcckSrr5WGrDqnQRyK-xKVDlJtvJuN8_pQ/w200-h183/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" width=\"200\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; text-align: right; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 242, 204); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">🕯️ מעט מן האור</span></h2><p style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-style: italic; text-align: right;\">לא, לא תעבור בי!<br />אפילו לא תתקרב!<br />אתה אומר \"אחי\".<br />אני אומר \"אויב\".</p><p style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-style: italic; text-align: right;\">אל תבקש כלום.<br />אל תשמיע דבר.<br /><br />האהבה כבתה.<br />השנאה ניעורה.</p><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; text-align: right; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 242, 204); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">📘 עצה שבועית</span></h2><p style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"></p><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לפעמים זה לא הזמן, לא המקום, לא האנשים.</span></div><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">גם את קיבלת “לא”.</span></div><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">תזכור: תמיד יש דרך אחרת.</span><span style=\"color: #626262; font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; font-size: 15px;\">.</span></span></div></span><p></p><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; text-align: right; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 242, 204); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">🌀 הצד השני של המטבע</span></h2><p style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #626262; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; text-align: right; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 242, 204); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"></span></p><div style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; text-align: right; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium;\">כשסוגרים דלת – גם הלב נסגר</span></div><div style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #626262; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; text-align: right; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" /></span></div><div style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; text-align: right; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 242, 204); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">💎 פנינה</span></h2><p style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">מלך אֱדוֹם = 135 = \"אל דמי לך\"<br /></p><p style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">שִׁיר מִזְמוֹר לְאָסָף; <br />אֱלֹהִים&nbsp;<b>אַל דֳּמִי לָךְ</b>&nbsp;<br />אַל תֶּחֱרַשׁ וְאַל תִּשְׁקֹט אֵל;<br />כִּי הִנֵּה אוֹיְבֶיךָ יֶהֱמָיוּן<br />וּמְשַׂנְאֶיךָ נָשְׂאוּ רֹאשׁ (תהילים)</span></p><h2 style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 242, 204); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">📘 מילון ארמי־עברי</span></h2><p style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #626262; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">חמש מילים מארמית שבתורה - עם פענוח והארה לשונית.</i></span></p><p style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #626262; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"></p><p style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #626262; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span face=\"Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"></span></p><ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; counter-reset: templateify 0; margin: 10px 0px; padding: 0px 20px 0px 0px;\"><li style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; counter-increment: templateify 1; list-style: none; margin: 8px 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">'</span><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">תְּלָאָה</b>' / '</span><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><i style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">עֲקְתָא</i>'</span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" /></span></span><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">❖&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">דבר שמכביד על הלב - מועקה</span></li><li style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; counter-increment: templateify 1; list-style: none; margin: 8px 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">'<b style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">וַיֵּרְדוּ</b>' / '<span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">וּנְחַתוּ</span>'<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" /></span></span><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">❖</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">עשו דרכם למטה - נחיתה</span></li><li style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; counter-increment: templateify 1; list-style: none; margin: 8px 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">'<b style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">עִיר</b>' / '<i style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">קַרְתָּא</i>'<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" /></span>❖&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">מקום ישוב קבוע - קִרְיָה</span></li><li style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; counter-increment: templateify 1; list-style: none; margin: 8px 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">'<b style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">בּוֹר</b>' / '<i style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">גּוּב</i>'<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" /></span></span><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">❖</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">חפירה, מאורה - גּוֹב אריות</span></li><li style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; counter-increment: templateify 1; list-style: none; margin: 8px 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">'<b style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">הָלַךְ</b>' / '<i style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">אָזַל</i>'<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" /></span>❖&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">הסתלק, נגמר - אזל הלחם</span></li></ol><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: black; display: inline !important; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 242, 204); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" /></span></h2><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: black; display: inline !important; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 242, 204); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><div style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"></span></div>👁️ מבט חד</span></h2></span></div><div style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; text-align: right; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj3el5KYPoxeNkK366XjUX2fdQLs005-pOl6CTaHNeiPULwDapW75-AmPIylxxISRS-YPcpZncXqXYSLEoI7YH6fK1tHkzl9K5NX31xoPj5Zu4aGYgZw9tAIVE7SdRNbES6dyU6ErCRf8KM6AeyfuduG4j6S0QIHJieYW23X4cMS6LUfj_9047v5hWKEdA/s191/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"clear: right; float: right; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-right: 1em; text-align: right;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"191\" data-original-width=\"178\" he